Responsible & Ethical AI Use
Transparency: The assistant clearly labels AI-generated content. Every email/summary has a footer option: "Drafted with AI - Please review".
Privacy: No meeting data is stored. Transcripts are processed in-memory only. No PII is sent to external models without consent.
Bias Mitigation: Prompts include instructions: "Use inclusive, unbiased language. Avoid assumptions about gender, role, or seniority."
Human-in-the-Loop: Critical actions (sending email, final task assignment) require human approval.
Hallucination Control: Research assistant prompt forces "If unsure, say 'I don't have verified information' and suggest search queries instead of inventing facts."
Sustainability: Model usage is optimized with concise prompts to reduce token waste.
